# Runtime Tools

Router rule. Triggers point at the reference material for the tool in
question.

## Load the relevant reference when any of these is true

- About to run any `node`, `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`, `npx`, `corepack`, or
  `bun` command in a project with a `.node-version`, `.nvmrc`, or
  `package.json#engines.node` → read the `fnm` section below.
- About to run any `docker` or `podman` command, to author a `Dockerfile`,
  `Containerfile`, `compose.yaml`, `compose.yml`, `docker-compose.yml`, or
  `podman-compose.yml`, or when the user asks which container tool to use →
  load the `container-tools` skill.

